  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. pony.py _get_member_expression_name/_collect_member_parts are unchanged since WI-rokus (afe6852023; e3b28358d8 touched discovery only). Fixture: in Main.create, `Churner(3).tick(0)` emits calls Main.create -> Main.tick and `Methods.client().register_capability()` emits calls -> Main.register_capability (the enclosing actor's own behaviours), plus a correct edge to Churner and an external Methods.client. Premise holds as filed; corpus count on ponyc still not measured. MECHANISM: pony _collect_member_parts keeps only identifier/member_expression children, so a call-expression receiver is dropped and the bare method name falls back to {current_type}.g in the same file. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-gufip."  # 5387
